2. Models used but not redistributed
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SpeechSplice is training-free and edits no weights. The experiments load
published frozen checkpoints from their original sources; none of them are
redistributed in this repository, and each remains under its own license and
terms of use:

    Aratako/T5Gemma-TTS-2b-2b          (gated; accept the license on Hugging Face)
    microsoft/speecht5_tts             (SpeechT5)
    Qwen3-TTS
    VoiceCraft
    EdiTTS
    openai/whisper-large-v3, openai/whisper-medium.en
    Parakeet-Inc/furigana_whisper_small_jsut
    facebook/wav2vec2-xlsr-53-espeak-cv-ft
    UTMOS (sarulab-speech/UTMOS22)
    WavLM-SV (microsoft/wavlm-base-plus-sv)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Speech data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Voice prompts were drawn from LibriTTS and from in-house recordings. No
synthesized audio is redistributed here: the generated waveforms clone a
prompt speaker's voice, so the repository releases the item lists, the scoring
code, and the per-sample scores instead.
